      "name": "Abhishek Shah",
      "created_at": "2025-12-31T10:23:38.575Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m testing out the new Frappe V16 with ERPNext on my local machine. This is the newest code as of this morning, and trying to add an App I am developing into the desktop. So I tried creating a Workspace … no success. Then tried creating Workspace Sidebar, and was at least able to get the sidebar to show my custom doctypes.</p>\n<p>But upon trying to edit, move the icons around in the sidebar, when I try to save it seems to corrupt the desk and it shows up as blank. Here is a screenshot of what it looks like and it generates an error on the console.</p>\n<p>Any suggestions??</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/e/2ec447a53b7458b9173c63998035c24ae0ba3c7e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/2ec447a53b7458b9173c63998035c24ae0ba3c7e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/e/2ec447a53b7458b9173c63998035c24ae0ba3c7e_2_690x368.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"6FIusBov3VsrJPRP7TaJaXWwLv0\" width=\"690\" height=\"368\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/e/2ec447a53b7458b9173c63998035c24ae0ba3c7e_2_690x368.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/e/2ec447a53b7458b9173c63998035c24ae0ba3c7e_2_1035x552.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/e/2ec447a53b7458b9173c63998035c24ae0ba3c7e_2_1380x736.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"2D2A2A\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2868×1533 174 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
